╭──────────────────────────── Keybindings ─────────────────────────────╮
│                                                                      │
│ PR REVIEW                                                            │
│  R              │ Submit review (verdict + body)                     │
│  i              │ Toggle PR info panel                               │
│  C              │ Comment target: GitHub ⇄ local                     │
│  r              │ Refresh diff + refetch threads                     │
│  Enter          │ Reply to thread (on thread)                        │
│  e              │ Edit your comment (on thread)                      │
│  x              │ Resolve / unresolve (on thread)                    │
│  d              │ Delete your comment (on thread)                    │
│  o              │ Fold / expand thread (on thread)                   │
│                                                                      │
╰───────────────────────── ? or Esc to close ──────────────────────────╯